ポイントが3.00 を超えることはありません。\nGrade points by this designated formula differ from a regular GPA.　Points do not exceed 3.00. \n小数点第２位まで記入してください。 (小数点第3位は四捨五入)\nPoints must be rounded to the second decimal place. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n<6> 大学院生の参加条件　Conditions for Graduate Students\n国際交流センターに応募する大学院生のみ，以下の事項に承諾し，✔印を記入してください。\nGraduate students shall agree to the following conditions upon application and tick ✔the box below: |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n①\t国際交流センターに所属する大学院生は，原則，各大学院が開講する科目を聴講することはできません。\n②\t国際交流センターに所属する大学院生に対して，専門分野を指導する指導教員はいません。\n1.\tGraduate-level students enrolled in International Exchange Center are not allowed to take subjects offered by graduate schools as a general rule.\n2.\tNo academic advisor will be assigned to supervise study of their specialization/major for graduate students enrolled in International Exchange Center. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 